OL,3,ABurnham not doing enough to boost
OL,4,Agrowth, says former business secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If the destination means prosperity,
OL,7,Fit means freedom for people to do new
OL,8,Fthings, and it means security for
OL,9,Fpeople and families, then why wouldn't
OL,10,Fwe put our foot down and get there
OL,11,Fquicker," the former business secretary
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FIt comes as Labour prepares to gather
OL,15,Fin Liverpool for its annual conference.
